# A game recorded and played back (docs/phase-replay.md, stage RP3): terran01's five marines boxed and sent east, the
# simulation's state CRC (sim.crc) marked at a step; Quit Mission writes LastReplay.rep (EndGame 0x443db0), and `replay` plays it as Load
# Replay's Ok does. The playback's console is a replay's (statbtnn, the time panel), its game reaches the marked step with
# the same state, and the end of its record opens the victory dialog's "The replay has finished." with Exit Replay
# (a mission's run has no glue: the score screen is Load Replay's). tools/ci.sh wants exit code 0 and "0 failures".
mission terran/terran01
video originals
clock fixed

wait game
wait frames 30
include determinism_select.kps
rclick world 700 200
wait tick >= 160
pause
mark played
log played tick sim.crc
state played
resume
# a later block: the record's last one is never played (FeedReplayCommands 0x4769b0, as 1.17 loses it)
rclick world 200 400
wait tick >= 200
menu quit-mission
wait dialog quit2mnu
activate ok
wait frames 10

replay "LastReplay"
wait game and replay
expect replay.frames >= @played.tick
wait tick >= @played.tick
pause
log replayed tick sim.crc
state replayed
expect tick == @played.tick
expect sim.crc == @played.sim.crc
ui statbtnn
resume
wait replay.ended == 1 within 60000
wait dialog wmission
ui wmission
activate ok
wait frames 10
